+- **Material colours are themeable in the classic anatomy too.** The measured
+  artwork already read `--odon-rest-*` / `--odon-fill-*`, but the default
+  (classic) artwork hard-coded its fills and gradient stops, so a host could
+  not recolour a zircon crown or the metal-ceramic ramp. The six classic
+  templates now read the same variables, with each classic colour kept as the
+  fallback — the default rendering is unchanged.
