 ```
 
+**Material colours:** restorations and fillings read CSS variables in both
+anatomy profiles, with the stock colour as the fallback — set any of them on
+`.odontogram-root` (or `:root`) to recolour a material:
+
+```css
+.odontogram-root {
+  --odon-rest-zircon: #e8eef3;           /* also: -gold, -gradia, -metal, -temporary */
+  --odon-rest-metal-ceramic-0: #f6f1e7;  /* 9-step ramps: -metal-ceramic-0…8, -emax-0…8 */
+  --odon-fill-composite: #f3ead2;        /* also: -amalgam, -gic, -temporary */
+}
+```
+
+Other variables: `--odon-rest-telescope`, `--odon-rest-telescope-inner`,
+`--odon-rest-telescope-connector`, `--odon-rest-telescope-connector-anterior`,
+`--odon-rest-denture-base`, `--odon-rest-denture-tooth`. The bridge saddle
+drawn between tiles keeps its solid colours.
+
 **Plugin integration:**
 ```tsx
 import App, { type OdontogramPlugin, setPluginState } from "./App";
